    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abarongoye abantu baja kuba i Yerusalemu. Ku bandi bantu habanza kugirwa ubupfindo, ngo bamenye umuryango umwe ku miryango icumi uja kuba i Yerusalemu, igisagara cera. Iyo miryango icenda isigaye bategerezwa kuguma mu bisagara vyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bahezagira cane abemeye ku gushaka kwabo kuja kuba i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandi Bisirayeli basigaye, hamwe n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, baba mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda, umwe wese mw’itongo rya ba sekuruza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakozi bo mu Ngoro baba ku musozi wa Ofeli, kandi Ziha na Gishupa ni bo bari babarongoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukuru w’Abalewi i Yerusalemu yari Uzi mwene Bani, Bani mwene Hashabiya, Hashabiya mwene Mataniya, Mataniya mwene Mika. Uzi yari umwe mu bakomotse kuri Asafu, bari abaririmvyi bajejwe igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaririmvyi bategekwa n’umwami, ni we yagena ivyo bakora ku musi ku musi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petahiya mwene Meshezabeli, umwe mu bakomotse kuri Zera mwene Yuda, yari umukozi w’umwami mu bikorwa vyose vyerekeye kurongora abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bijanye n’ibigwati n’imirima yavyo, bamwe mu bantu b’i Buyuda baba i Kiriyati-Araba no mu bigwati bihakikije, i Diboni no mu bigwati vyaho, i Yekabuzeyeli no mu bigwati vyaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Yesuwa, i Molada, i Beti-Peleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Hazari-Shuwali, i Berisheba no mu bigwati vyaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Zikulagi, i Mekona no mu bigwati vyaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Eni-Rimoni, i Zora, i Yarimuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i Zanowa, muri Adulamu no mu bigwati vyaho, i Lakishi no mu mirima yaho, n’i Azeka no mu bigwati vyaho. Nuko baba ngaho uhereye i Berisheba gushika mu kiyaya ca Hinomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
